Leopard/PowerPC: AltiVec VP9 DSP (8-bit 8-tap MC put/avg h/v/hv for all block sizes, all loop filters).
Generic AltiVec (G4/G5/e6500, no VSX), big-endian, gated on HAVE_ALTIVEC and PPC_ALTIVEC(av_get_cpu_flags()).
Bit-exact with the C code (checkasm vp9dsp, 50+ seeds; md5 of decoded clips). A/B: LEOPARD_VP9_NO_ALTIVEC_MC=1,
LEOPARD_VP9_NO_ALTIVEC_LPF=1. See docs/altivec-media-audit.md.

